The dish is a square plate about 26 cm across in the image, which is rotated. The food is a small pile of pearl (Israeli) couscous with some greens and possibly tofu or cheese. The pile measures roughly 200 px by 190 px, and the plate spans about 450 px, so the pile is around 11 cm by 10 cm at about 2 cm high.

Cooked couscous is roughly 1.5 kcal/g. I estimate about 120 g of food, which gives about 190 kcal. Visible oil and the small pieces add a little, so I round to about 200 kcal.

